  "details": "this feature request was wrote with some contribution from @Hatson321 {SNAKE.8410} \n\nThe Idea\n\nreposition the Public instances on the very bottom of the list, Group Public instances on top of the Public instances, then Verified18+ instances on top of Group Public instances, and Group+ instances on top of Verified18+ instances, and Group instances on top of Group+ instances, Friend+ instances on top of Group instances, and finally at the very top you can put Friend instances\n\nWhy like this\n\nthis way you can get the best experience at the top!\n\nWhy choose it\n\nif a new user joins a public instance of the Furry Hideout, it will not be as good as if they joined a Group Public with active staff\n\nwhile if you run group+ instances and your instance is visible at the top then people will enter more willingly, same with group publics, they will be seen more, this system gives more visibility to high quality instances.",
